        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprises DS-55 Decorative Floral Door Stop</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis decorative floral design floor mount door stop combines a petal flower top with a traditional reed style base.  It is equally suited for use in private residential or commercial applications.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNot just for decoration.  Solid floor mount design provides excellent protection for your walls and door hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Other Field Enterprises <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Field Enterprises Decorative Door Stops\"><b>Field Enterprises Door Stops</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nOnly one hole to drill makes installation fast and easy.  Packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of Field Enterprises FEI-DS-55 Floral  Door Stop\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Floor to Bumper Height: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Bumper Ring: Black Rubber</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li> \r\n<li>Mounting Hardware:  #12 x 1-1/2\" screw</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
